# Production build: PocketBase is OFF unless you turn it on.
#
# There is deliberately no VITE_PB_URL default here. A default would be baked
# into every production bundle by `vite build`, and a localhost default points
# each player's browser at their own machine rather than at a save server -
# so the game would silently fall back to per-browser localStorage while
# looking configured. Failing closed to localStorage is the honest default;
# a save server that is not there is better than one that is not reachable.
#
# To use a real PocketBase, supply the URL at build time:
#
#   VITE_PB_URL=https://pb.example.com npm run build
#
# or put it in an untracked .env.production.local, which Vite loads and merges
# over this file:
#
#   echo 'VITE_PB_URL=https://pb.example.com' > .env.production.local
#
# With VITE_PB_URL unset the app uses LocalStorageGameStore: saves stay in this
# browser only, and clearing site data loses them.